uld move three slots and leave one. But since D1.2 says lada is not identity, this is acceptable.\n\nBut let's try TAMU with 3 slots first. Let me try TAMU = {q1_1, q1_2, q1_3}. Let lada be a 3-cycle: q1_1\u2192q1_2\u2192q1_3\u2192q1_1. Then lada^3 is identity. \n\nNow", "class": "INVALID", "logprobs": {"sum_logprob": -2616.7041885876206, "n_tokens": 12000}, "answer_chars": 34123}
